    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "We checked the fabric and the ink batches are both the same as usual, so it's hard to see why it would fluctuate like this. The heat distribution seems okay too since the temperature sensors show it hitting 200C across the plate. It's just like the pigment is disappearing mid-process. Is there any other chemical or mechanical reason why the ink would just fail to bond or seem to vanish during the press?",
